      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is completely understandable that you feel devastated when your sense of self seems so fractured by external opinions. When the internal narrative clashes so sharply with how you feel you are perceived, it can feel like a profound loss of self. Please remember that while online commentary can be harsh, it is a curated, tiny echo that does not define the entire depth of who you are as a human being. If the feeling of hopelessness is very strong, please reach out to a crisis line immediately for urgent connection and support.",
