      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "These feelings of complete alienation and being judged by those close to you are deeply isolating and terrifying. It sounds like the environment around you has become so charged with perceived judgment that it feels suffocating. If you are having thoughts about wanting to stop the pain completely, please know there are people who want to help you through this moment. You can call or text 988 anytime in the US and Canada to connect with trained crisis counselors immediately.",
      "source": "target",
